{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>方力申近日透露父親約3周前在睡夢期間突然病發，右半身一度無法活動，更因病發時間不明而錯過施用薄血針的黃金治療期 …</p><p></p>\n<p>方力申近日透露父親約3周前在睡夢期間突然病發，右半身一度無法活動，更因病發時間不明而錯過施用薄血針的黃金治療期。</p>\n<h2>方力申親述父親睡夢病發入ICU經過</h2>\n<p>方力申出席活動時透露父親在三周前在睡夢期間突然缺血性中風，最嚴重時右半身更一度癱瘓。 他憶述父親入院時神志清醒，甚至反問家人：「我中風咩？」方爸爸其後入住深切治療部ICU數日，目前仍留院接受物理治療、言語治療及針灸，並由營養師跟進飲食需要。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e6%96%b9%e5%8a%9b%e7%94%b3-%e8%91%89%e8%90%b1-%e6%96%b9%e6%84%9b%e5%98%89-bb%e6%94%b9%e5%90%8d-%e4%b8%ad%e6%96%87%e5%90%8d-%e6%96%b9%e5%8a%9b%e7%94%b3%e6%bc%94%e5%94%b1%e6%9c%83-2359569/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BB改名｜葉萱14歲神預言嫁方力申超神奇 女兒中文名曝光 1字搵師傅改</a></p>\n<h2>中風發病前現三大先兆</h2>\n<p>方力申憶述爸爸病發前一晚曾感到疲倦、頭暈及食慾不振，但由於較早前曾經更換藥物，醫生亦提醒新藥可能令人較疲倦，故此當時家人當時難以分辨究竟是藥物反應，還是中風先兆。其後，方爸爸在睡眠期間發病，清醒送院時右半身已不能活動，也無法自行移動，處於癱瘓狀態。由於沒有人能準確掌握中風時間，醫生指錯過了使用薄血針的黃金治療期，使情況更為棘手。方力申表示，幸好父親康復速度較預期快，整體進展良好，目前在醫院接受物理治療、言語治療及針灸，並諮詢營養師。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/%e6%96%b9%e5%8a%9b%e7%94%b3-%e6%96%b9%e6%84%9b%e5%98%89-%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82%e6%96%b0%e8%81%9e-2446889/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">方力申晒愛女爬樓梯片意外洩豪宅內貌 近半億獨立屋奢華裝潢震撼網民</a>\n</p>\n<h2>孫女Isla探成方爸爸康復「最好嘅藥」</h2>\n<p>真正令方爸爸精神明顯好轉的，正是孫女Isla。方力申形容女兒是父親「最好嘅藥」，又指Isla好錫爺爺。Isla探病時會主動靠近爺爺，兩人更會頭貼頭互動；方爸爸見到孫女後，說話亦由氣聲變得更有中氣。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/%e6%96%b9%e5%8a%9b%e7%94%b3-%e8%91%89%e8%90%b1-%e6%94%9d%e7%90%86%e6%95%99-2364758/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">方力申太太葉萱現身HKU再爆邪教倖存真相！16歲誤入歧途被洗腦震撼</a></p>\n<p>家人現計劃在12月Isla生日安排方爸爸請假回家，期望他能在協助下活動，並於聖誕節前出院。談及醫療開支時，他坦言費用達幾十萬元，幸好能與弟弟共同承擔，兩兄弟在突發情況下互相支持。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/%e6%96%b9%e5%8a%9b%e7%94%b3-%e8%91%89%e8%90%b1-%e9%99%a4%e7%96%a3-%e5%82%b3%e6%9f%93%e7%97%85-%e6%96%b0%e6%89%8b%e5%aa%bd%e5%aa%bd-2359516/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">方力申太太葉萱頸部佈滿紅斑除疣防傳染病 擔心愛女Isla中招痛下決心</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e6%96%b9%e5%8a%9b%e7%94%b3-%e8%91%89%e8%90%b1-isia-%e5%a5%b3%e5%85%92-%e7%99%bc%e7%87%92-maple-%e6%b8%af%e6%80%a1%e9%86%ab%e9%99%a2-2325522/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">方力申葉萱女兒IsIa提早出世發燒 一家三口全家福首曝光</a></p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500848926314550_12906044406afda7eb6dbbb.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"方力申 爸爸 （圖片來源：YouTube@Viu1 HK）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500848926314550_12906044406afda7eb6dbbb.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@Viu1 HK）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500849714682862_14251788456afda7f20dd51.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"方力申 爸爸 （圖片來源：Instagram@alexfongliksun）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500849714682862_14251788456afda7f20dd51.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Instagram@alexfongliksun）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500851212827825_9221502696afda80142041.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"方力申 爸爸 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500851212827825_9221502696afda80142041.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500851440990406_4971637656afda8036f90a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"方力申 爸爸 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500851440990406_4971637656afda8036f90a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e6%96%b9%e5%8a%9b%e7%94%b3-%e8%91%89%e8%90%b1-%e6%96%b9%e6%84%9b%e5%98%89-bb%e6%94%b9%e5%90%8d-%e4%b8%ad%e6%96%87%e5%90%8d-%e6%96%b9%e5%8a%9b%e7%94%b3%e6%bc%94%e5%94%b1%e6%9c%83-2359569/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BB改名｜葉萱14歲神預言嫁方力申超神奇 女兒中文名曝光 1字搵師傅改</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/%e6%96%b9%e5%8a%9b%e7%94%b3-%e6%96%b9%e6%84%9b%e5%98%89-%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82%e6%96%b0%e8%81%9e-2446889/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">方力申晒愛女爬樓梯片意外洩豪宅內貌 近半億獨立屋奢華裝潢震撼網民</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/%e6%96%b9%e5%8a%9b%e7%94%b3-%e8%91%89%e8%90%b1-%e6%94%9d%e7%90%86%e6%95%99-2364758/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">方力申太太葉萱現身HKU再爆邪教倖存真相！16歲誤入歧途被洗腦震撼</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/%e6%96%b9%e5%8a%9b%e7%94%b3-%e8%91%89%e8%90%b1-%e9%99%a4%e7%96%a3-%e5%82%b3%e6%9f%93%e7%97%85-%e6%96%b0%e6%89%8b%e5%aa%bd%e5%aa%bd-2359516/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">方力申太太葉萱頸部佈滿紅斑除疣防傳染病 擔心愛女Isla中招痛下決心</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e6%96%b9%e5%8a%9b%e7%94%b3-%e8%91%89%e8%90%b1-isia-%e5%a5%b3%e5%85%92-%e7%99%bc%e7%87%92-maple-%e6%b8%af%e6%80%a1%e9%86%ab%e9%99%a2-2325522/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">方力申葉萱女兒IsIa提早出世發燒 一家三口全家福首曝光</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/icu/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ICU</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%ad%ab%e5%a5%b3isla/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">孫女isla</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%96%b9%e5%8a%9b%e7%94%b3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">方力申</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%88%b8%e7%88%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">爸爸</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：YouTube@Viu1 HK、Instagram@alexfongliksun、TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/2456849\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於SundayKiss</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e7%b6%b2%e7%b5%a1%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">網絡熱話</a>\nNov 18 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T16:04:13.333468+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1218,"images":4,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T14:07:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T16:18:02.075600+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T15:57:43.858020+00:00","content_hash":"f3a69ad3b94486051c3ee189cd93f18bc78cdc358bad4557b96d582b52664788","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}